Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This disrupts the function of the basal ganglia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to transplant your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only donor we have...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll just sign here, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what the hell, one brain or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep now, as I uncover the secrets of your mind.
